  "releaseNotes": "Release 2.0.2.0: a patient the London Data Service does not hold is reported as a not found patient.\n\t\t\tThe service localises the dependency's HTTP 404 as NotFoundPatientException, categorised as the new PatientDependencyValidationException, instead of the FailedPatientDependencyException used for every other HTTP failure.\n\t\t\tPatientDependencyValidationException implements IFhirDependencyException, as PatientDependencyException does, so consumers that handle failures by marker see no change.\n\t\t\tThe HttpRequestException stays inside the chain, so consumers can still read the 404 status.\n\t\t\tNo other public API changes since 2.0.1.",
